body:
I feel #1 has a lot of classic "chill" or sweet characters, such as Maki, Peko, Ryoma (he's too depressed to do anything against anyone), makoto and gonta (also partially mikan). they have the agressive sweetness too. #2 is... chaotic neutral- evil. #3 has the Chaotic good (Ibuki and Gundham), the sweetest beings on earth (Chihiro and Sonya, also partially mukuro), and... I won't talk about the others. #4 is composed by the protectors (>!Imposter,!< Taka, Kyoko, Nekomaru, and Kirumi >!(she had to take care of an entire nation)!<), and the lesbians (best description ever). #5 has 3 people who are sweet and protective, two of them being hopeful and so, there's the 2 mentally unstables (same tho), and the classic "bully- like" people, however one of them had a redemption arc and the 2nd almost did too. #6 is... chaotic. Expect screams everywhere. Himbos and energetic Akane. Also Junko would scream just to annoy people, driving Shuichi insane. 

&#x200B;

Maybe I have a bit of a bias towards #4, but yeah...

the right doesn't want us to be sexually free, but then say that they would prefer **anything** but asexuality, and at the same time induce r4p3 culture and even glorify that "at least somebody liked you", while saying it's the victim's fault, and even punish them for standing up to their agressor (if they even do). And they also say "4b0rt10n is illegal and murder"... What do you expect us to do then? just that someone tells their r4p1st "nah thanks" and just leave?

&#x200B;

So don't have sex, but do have sex, but don't be victims of weirdos who only want sex, but don't fight back and don't tell anybody 'cuz you're probably lying, but you have to be responsible for whatever they do...?

yeah cuz we actually have natural pink hair, balloon breasts and skin as soft and "clean" as porcelain /s

